 was he born? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Fred</span>: \t\tHe was born in Barbados.", "image": "engenn1le06ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "30000", "id": 2}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: \tWhat was his job there? <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Fred</span>:\tHe was a sailor. He moved to Vancouver, Canada in 1885. He was a well-loved swimming instructor. He was the first lifeguard at English Bay. Many people here were his students.", "image": "engenn1le06ob04re2img01.jpg", "time": "33900", "id": 3}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena", "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Personal History"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Why Was He a Hero?"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 6}, {"type": "level", "content": "Beginner"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "proud"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "strong feelings for someone you care about"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We are proud of our son."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le06ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you hear when you talk about someone's life."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "brave"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "not afraid to take risks"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The brave man is not afraid of danger. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn1le06ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "legendary"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "popular  and admired"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Joe Fortes was a legendary hero